needs two minutes, and it's the difference between a pleasant conversation and real progress.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Still recording; nothing changed.","calls":[],"decisionMs":3101.121125000005,"totalMs":3101.134458000015,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":13,"timedOut":false},{"turn":26,"said":"None of this needs new software or a bigger budget. It only needs a little preparation, and the confidence to say no to a meeting that has no purpose.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Still recording; nothing changed.","calls":[],"decisionMs":3347.502415999974,"totalMs":3347.5215409999946,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":13,"timedOut":false},{"turn":27,"said":"If one of these habits helps your team, let me know in the comments. Thank you for watching, and I'll see you next week.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Still recording; nothing changed.","calls":[],"decisionMs":3465.000208000012,"totalMs":3465.0170409999846,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":13,"timedOut":false},{"turn":28,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording stopped; the take is saved to the card.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":3877.7172079999873,"totalMs":7437.345791,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":67,"timedOut":false},{"turn":29,"said":"What's on the card?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer about the card; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"The card has four videos and no photos; the newest two are today's takes.","calls":[{"name":"list_card_files","arguments":{"limit":50},"valid":true,"changesSomething":false}],"decisionMs":7203.009374999994,"totalMs":7203.022916999995,"steps